REASONING: TESTS WOULD FAIL AGAINST HEAD
================================================================================

The new tests depend on features not present in HEAD:

1. stopSignal parameter: HEAD's ResearchRunOptions lacks this parameter
   → All FR38 tests that pass stopSignal would fail with type error

2. stopWriteMs setting: HEAD's ResearchSettings lacks this field
   → Test "default stopWriteMs is 60000" would fail

3. stopController in GenerationRecord: HEAD lacks this field
   → Manager tests would fail to set up deep research with Stop behavior

4. Two-stage Stop logic: HEAD has only one-stage Stop (hard abort)
   → HTTP tests expecting wrap-up behavior would fail:
