     * Write step would not run
     * Report would be absent
     * done.research.status would be absent or "cancelled"

5. Sources emission on hard abort: HEAD lacks this code
   → Test "(d) hard abort during short write-up" expects sources event
     This would not be emitted in HEAD

6. deepResearchStop.test.ts: File does not exist in HEAD
   → All tests in this file would not run

